# Copy to .env and fill in. Loaded from this directory by explicit path.
# This file is for per-project OVERRIDES only. Inference keys go in the repo-root compute.env.

# Inference keys are configured centrally in the repo-root compute.env (see ../COMPUTE.md).
# trace-guard's default models are closed GPT-4o, so set OPENROUTER_API_KEY there (NEBIUS_API_KEY
# alone only covers open models on Nebius).

# Optional: enable the intent analyzer (a second-opinion pass by Claude Opus that runs
# only when the heuristic detectors flag something). Disabled when unset, as shipped.
# Any inspect-ai model string works here if you want a different one -- see the README note on cost.
# INTENT_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-4.6

# Optional: model used by scripts/run_posthoc.py when --model is not given.
# INSPECT_EVAL_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini
